crates/wallet/src/ripemd160.rs is a clean-room RIPEMD-160 (ISO/IEC 10118-3)
re-derived from the published specification. It is a copy of the module used by
the closed-source Forager miner, and is not derived from any third-party
implementation.

crates/wallet/src/poseidon2b/ (the Poseidon2b permutation, sponge and GF(2^128)
change-of-basis tables) and crates/wallet/src/families/noid.rs (the Parano1d
master-secret and address derivation) contain constants and constructions
ported from Parano1d, https://git.parano1d.org/ignotusnemo/parano1d, commit
52938433, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The portable GF(2^128)
multiply is Forager's own. Parano1d's NOTICE reads, in the part that applies:

